OL,3,GNEWSAAnger as workmen rip out 'lovely'
OL,4,Aalley garden
OL,5,
OL,6,FResidents who spent years developing a
OL,7,Fcommunity garden in an alleyway came
OL,8,Fhome to find workmen had ripped it out.
OL,10,FThey said they had spent five years
OL,11,Fgrowing fruit trees and decking out the
OL,12,FLevenshume, Greater Manchester alley -
OL,13,Fsome of it paid for by Manchester City
OL,14,FCouncil funding.
OL,16,FBut Tom Marrett and Maeve Cowan
OL,17,Freturned home to find everything gone,
OL,18,Fincluding a mature grapevine.
OL,23,APub: 31-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NW Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
FL,410,400,260,160,0,100
